  <name>AniCh</name>
  <summary>支持超分辨率的在线动漫弹幕播放器</summary>

  <description>
    <p>一个支持超分辨率的在线动漫弹幕 APP。多平台，多番剧源，多弹幕，高清无广告。追番看番必备软件。</p>
    <p>
      AniCh is a cross-platform online anime player. It aggregates multiple
      anime sources and danmaku providers, and upscales playback in real time
      with the Anime4K shaders it ships.
    </p>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">org.eu.emmmm.anich.desktop</launchable>

